{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012412001:2":{"text":"정말 신기하네요! 이방인이 달빛 그림자에 오다니. 저희 할아버지 대부터 이방인은 본 적이 없는데.","source_cn":"太神奇啦！竟然有外乡人到月影乡来，自打我爷爷那辈起，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC40FDDE709F3510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012412002:0":{"text":"많이 피곤해 보이는데 좀 앉으시겠어요? 특히 눈 가린 오빠~ 뭐 마실래요?","source_cn":"你们看起来很疲惫，要不要坐一坐？尤其是那位蒙着眼睛的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E11E0A429520DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012412003:1":{"text":"괜찮습니다.","source_cn":"不必。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0559EB3B5FD0F6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012412004:0":{"text":"완전 쌀쌀 맞아. 더 마음에 들어!\n저기요, 잘 생긴 오빠, 이름이 뭐예요? 애인 있어요?","source_cn":"好冷淡哦，我更喜欢了！\\n小哥哥，你叫什么名字？有没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B7B9344092F7FE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012412005:1":{"text":"여기 남자들은 모두 유치해서 마음에 안 들어요. 전 당신처럼 차분하고 듬직한 사람이 좋아요!","source_cn":"这里的男人都很幼稚，我不喜欢，我喜欢像你这样深沉稳重的类型！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5030367D4CA66CAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen